  "template": "Metric Generic Model.rft",
  "about": "Palm modelled as a generic product: mulch ring, root boss, tall trunk with twelve leaf-scar rings, crown shaft, four arching fronds on the main axes and four diagonal fronds in three drooping segments, a skirt of old frond bases, two spear fronds, two fruit clusters. Geometry drawn for 6m_Palm; the other types share it (sizes in the values). Reference: query: planting palm planting hospital; images: https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=planting+palm+planting+hospital; basis: generic product; brand, model and supplier open for review",
